  m_text: '<color=#FFD034>Two players</color> compete in a cowboy gunfight where
    <color=#FFD034>quick reaction </color>and shooting accuracy determine the winner.

    The
    demo showcases the crucial role of <color=#FFD034>5G networks</color> in <color=#FFD034>online
    gaming</color>, emphasizing how<color=#FFD034> low latency </color>supports fast
    reflexes and real-time gameplay.

'
